    "id": "stat_06",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 4,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 3,
    "question_en": "The frequency table below shows the number of pets owned by 20 families. Find the mean number of pets. \\[ \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|} \\hline \\text{No. of Pets } (x) & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline \\text{Frequency } (f) & 4 & 7 & 5 & 3 & 1 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} \\]",
    "question_zh": "下表顯示 20 個家庭擁有的寵物數量。求寵物數量的平均值。 \\[ \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|} \\hline \\text{寵物數量 } (x) & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline \\text{頻數 } (f) & 4 & 7 & 5 & 3 & 1 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} \\]",
    "answer": "1.5",
    "correct_answer": "1.5",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. Total pets: \\( \\\\sum f x = 0(4) + 1(7) + 2(5) + 3(3) + 4(1) = 30 \\).",
      "2. Total families \\( n = 20 \\).",
      "3. Mean = \\( 30 / 20 = 1.5 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. 寵物總數：\\( \\sum f x = 30 \\)。",
      "2. 家庭總數 \\( n = 20 \\)。",
      "3. 平均值 = \\( 30 / 20 = 1.5 \\)。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
  {
    "id": "stat_07",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 4,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 3,
    "question_en": "The frequency table below shows the marks of a quiz. Find the interquartile range (IQR). \\[ \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|} \\hline \\text{Score } (x) & 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ \\hline \\text{Frequency } (f) & 3 & 5 & 8 & 6 & 2 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} \\]",
    "question_zh": "下表顯示得分的分佈。求得分的四分位位距 (IQR)。",
    "answer": "2",
    "correct_answer": "2",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. \\( n = 24 \\). \\( Q_1 \\) is at \\( 24 \\\\times 0.25 = 6 \\)th position.",
      "2. Cumulative frequencies: (2): 3, (3): 8. Thus \\( Q_1 = 3 \\).",
      "3. \\( Q_3 \\) is at \\( 24 \\\\times 0.75 = 18 \\)th position.",
      "4. Cumulative: (4): 16, (5): 22. Thus \\( Q_3 = 5 \\).",
      "5. IQR = \\( 5 - 3 = 2 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. \\( n = 24 \\)。\\( Q_1 \\) 位於第 6 個位置。",
      "2. 累積頻數：(2): 3, (3): 8。故 \\( Q_1 = 3 \\)。",
      "3. \\( Q_3 \\) 位於第 18 個位置。",
      "4. 累積頻數至 (4): 16, (5): 22。故 \\( Q_3 = 5 \\)。",
      "5. IQR = \\( 5 - 3 = 2 \\)。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
  {
