    "id": "stat_09",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 4,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 3,
    "question_en": "From an Ogive, the cumulative frequency of 40 kg is 35 and 60 kg is 80. If the total is 100, how many items are between 40 and 60 kg?",
    "question_zh": "在一累積頻數圖中，40 kg 的累積頻數為 35，60 kg 為 80。總數為 100，求重量介乎 40 與 60 kg 的項目數量。",
    "answer": "45",
    "correct_answer": "45",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. Number = Cumulative frequency (60) - Cumulative frequency (40) = \\( 80 - 35 = 45 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. 數量 = 累積頻數 (60) - 累積頻數 (40) = \\( 80 - 35 = 45 \\)。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
