    "id": "stat_10",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 4,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 3,
    "question_en": "The frequency table shows the number of siblings of 10 students. Find the median. \\[ \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|} \\hline \\text{Siblings} & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline \\text{Frequency} & 2 & 3 & 4 & 1 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array} \\]",
    "question_zh": "下表顯示 10 名學生的兄弟姐妹人數。求數據的中位數。",
    "answer": "1.5",
    "correct_answer": "1.5",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. \\( n = 10 \\). Median is average of 5th and 6th values.",
      "2. Order: (0,0,1,1,1,2,2,2,2,3).",
      "3. 5th is 1, 6th is 2.",
      "4. Median = \\( (1 + 2) / 2 = 1.5 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. \\( n = 10 \\)。中位數是第 5 個及第 6 個數值的平均值。",
      "2. 有序數據：(0,0,1,1,1,2,2,2,2,3)。",
      "3. 第 5 個是 1，第 6 個是 2。",
      "4. 中位數 = 1.5。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
  {
    "id": "stat_11",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 5,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 4,
    "question_en": "The stem-and-leaf diagram below shows the ages of 11 employees. The median age is 34. Find the value of \\( x \\). \\[ \\begin{array}{r|l} \\text{Stem (10)} & \\text{Leaf (1)} \\\\ \\hline 2 & 2, 5, 8 \\\\ 3 & 1, 3, x, 7 \\\\ 4 & 0, 4, 6, 9 \\end{array} \\]",
    "question_zh": "下表顯示 11 名員工的年齡。年齡的中位數為 34。求 \\( x \\) 的值。 \\[ \\begin{array}{r|l} \\text{莖 (10)} & \\text{葉 (1)} \\\\ \\hline 2 & 2, 5, 8 \\\\ 3 & 1, 3, x, 7 \\\\ 4 & 0, 4, 6, 9 \\end{array} \\]",
    "answer": "4",
    "correct_answer": "4",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. \\( n = 11 \\). The median is the 6th value.",
      "2. Counting from the smallest: (22, 25, 28, 31, 33, 30+x).",
      "3. The 6th value is \\( 30 + x = 34 \\\\implies x = 4 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. \\( n = 11 \\)。中位數是第 6 個數據。",
      "2. 從最小點算：(22, 25, 28, 31, 33, 30+x)。",
      "3. 第 6 個數據是 \\( 30 + x = 34 \\\\implies x = 4 \\)。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
  {
    "id": "stat_12",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 5,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 3,
    "question_en": "The stem-and-leaf diagram shows the weights of 10 bags. The range of the weights is 25 kg. Find the value of \\( y \\). \\[ \\begin{array}{r|l} \\text{Stem (10)} & \\text{Leaf (1)} \\\\ \\hline 4 & 2, 5, 8 \\\\ 5 & 1, 3, 3, 7 \\\\ 6 & 0, 4, y \\end{array} \\]",
    "question_zh": "下表顯示 10 袋物品的重量。重量的全距為 25 kg。求 \\( y \\) 的值。 \\[ \\begin{array}{r|l} \\text{莖 (10)} & \\text{葉 (1)} \\\\ \\hline 4 & 2, 5, 8 \\\\ 5 & 1, 3, 3, 7 \\\\ 6 & 0, 4, y \\end{array} \\]",
    "answer": "7",
    "correct_answer": "7",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. Smallest = 42. Largest = \\( 60 + y \\).",
      "2. Range = \\( (60 + y) - 42 = 25 \\).",
      "3. \\( 18 + y = 25 \\\\implies y = 7 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. 最小值 = 42。最大值 = \\( 60 + y \\)。",
      "2. 全距 = \\( (60 + y) - 42 = 25 \\)。",
      "3. \\( 18 + y = 25 \\\\implies y = 7 \\)。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
  {
    "id": "stat_13",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 5,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 4,
    "question_en": "If the mean mark of 60, 70, 80 with frequencies 5, \\( k \\), 8 is 72, find the value of \\( k \\).",
    "question_zh": "若 60, 70, 80 的頻數分別為 5, \\( k \\), 8 且平均分為 72，求 \\( k \\) 的值。",
    "answer": "2",
    "correct_answer": "2",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. Mean = \\( \\\\frac{60(5) + 70(k) + 80(8)}{5 + k + 8} = 72 \\).",
      "2. \\( \\\\frac{300 + 70k + 640}{13 + k} = 72 \\).",
      "3. \\( 940 + 70k = 936 + 72k \\).",
      "4. \\( 2k = 4 \\\\implies k = 2 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. 平均值 = \\( \\\\frac{60(5) + 70(k) + 80(8)}{13 + k} = 72 \\)。",
      "2. \\( 940 + 70k = 936 + 72k \\)。",
      "3. \\( 2k = 4 \\\\implies k = 2 \\)。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
  {
    "id": "stat_14",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 5,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 4,
    "question_en": "If the median of scores 1(4), 2(6), 3(p), 4(5), 5(3) is 3, find the minimum possible value of \\( p \\).",
    "question_zh": "若得分 1(4), 2(6), 3(p), 4(5), 5(3) 的中位數為 3，求 \\( p \\) 的最小可能值。",
    "answer": "3",
    "correct_answer": "3",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. Cumulative frequency of scores 1 and 2 is 10.",
      "2. \\( n = 18 + p \\). Median is at \\( (18+p+1)/2 \\).",
      "3. For the median to be 3, the middle position must be \\( > 10 \\).",
      "4. \\( (19+p)/2 > 10 \\\\implies 19+p > 20 \\\\implies p > 1 \\).",
      "5. If \\( p=2, n=20 \\), median is average of 10th (2) and 11th (3) which is 2.5. Not 3.",
      "6. If \\( p=3, n=21 \\), median is 11th (3). Minimum \\( p = 3 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. 1 分及 2 分的累積頻數為 10。",
      "2. \\( n = 18 + p \\)。中位數位於第 \\( (19+p)/2 \\) 個位置。",
      "3. 為了使中位數為 3，中間位置必須大於 10。",
      "4. \\( (19+p)/2 > 10 \\\\implies p > 1 \\)。",
      "5. 若 \\( p=2, n=20 \\), 中位數是第 10(2) 與第 11(3) 的平均值為 2.5。不合。",
      "6. 若 \\( p=3, n=21 \\), 第 11 個是 3。最小 \\( p = 3 \\)。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
  {
    "id": "stat_15",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 5,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 3,
    "question_en": "A set of 19 values has mean 60. If outlier 140 is removed, find the new mean of the 18 items.",
    "question_zh": "一組 19 個數據平均值為 60。若移除離群值 140，求剩餘 18 項的新平均值。",
    "answer": "55.56",
    "correct_answer": "55.56",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. Sum = \\( 19 \\\\times 60 = 1140 \\).",
      "2. New sum = \\( 1140 - 140 = 1000 \\).",
      "3. New mean = \\( 1000 / 18 \\\\approx 55.56 \\)."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. 總和 = \\( 1140 \\)。",
      "2. 新總和 = \\( 1000 \\)。",
      "3. 新平均值 = \\( 1000 / 18 \\\\approx 55.56 \\)。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null
  },
  {
