  {
    "id": "stat_19",
    "topic_id": "math_stat_charts",
    "subject": "maths",
    "level": 5,
    "type": "short_answer",
    "marks": 5,
    "question_en": "Find \\( a, b \\) in stem-leaf with 10 data points if Mean=57.1 and Median=56. \\[ \\begin{array}{r|l} \\text{Stem} & \\text{Leaf} \\\\ \\hline 4 & 5, 8 \\\\ 5 & 2, 4, a, b \\\\ 6 & 1, 3, 7, 9 \\end{array} \\]",
    "question_zh": "10 個數據的幹葉圖中，若平均值為 57.1 且中位數為 56，求 \\( a \\) 及 \\( b \\)。",
    "answer": "a = 5, b = 7",
    "correct_answer": "5, 7",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "1. Total sum = \\( 57.1 \\\\times 10 = 571 \\).",
      "2. Sum of knowns = \\( 45+48+52+54+61+63+67+69 = 459 \\).",
      "3. \\( (50+a) + (50+b) = 571 - 459 = 112 \\\\implies a+b = 12 \\).",
      "4. Median \\( (50+a + 50+b)/2 = 56 \\\\implies a+b = 12 \\).",
      "5. If \\( a=5, b=7 \\), sorted leaves in Stem 5: [2, 4, 5, 7]. 5th is 55, 6th is 57. Median = 56."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "1. 總和 = 571。",
